00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:23.800
to basically decide the amount of money

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:26.160
you can pay for creators if they bring

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:27.520
downloads. And ARPU varies a lot between

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:28.839
countries. So, you must track this in a

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:29.960
very methodical way.

