00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:15.640
absolutely nothing. And they were

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:17.440
completely different designs. This tells

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:19.160
us, "Hey, let's not focus on here again.

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:20.760
This is an inconclusive test. Let's

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:22.320
focus on other areas of the app." For

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:24.000
